# React Frontend Rules

Canonical repository policy lives in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). Frontend
architecture expectations live in [Feature-Sliced Design](../../docs/frontend-fsd.md)
and [frontend state](../../docs/frontend-state.md).

This file is redirect-only. It must not contain independent rules. When policy
and this file disagree, AGENTS.md wins. External AI coding assistants are not
approved for repository work unless a maintainer explicitly changes that policy
for the current task.
